# 🧾️ libjpeg progressive scan script — DC for all three components, then an AC scan for component 0
# and one for component 1. Four Huffman tables are defined: 0x00/0x01 (DC luma/chroma) and 0x10/0x11
# (AC luma/chroma). This is the BEFORE half of the `remove-huffman-table` pair.
0 1 2: 0 0 0 0;
0: 1 63 0 0;
1: 1 63 0 0;
